.","refs":[["Acts",27,40,27,40]]},{"text":"The anchors. — Ac 27:29,40.","refs":[["Acts",27,29,27,29],["Acts",27,40,27,40]]},{"text":"The boats. — Ac 27:30,32.","refs":[["Acts",27,30,27,30],["Acts",27,32,27,32]]},{"text":"The oars. — Isa 33:21; Eze 27:6.","refs":[["Isa",33,21,33,21],["Ezek",27,6,27,6]]},{"text":"Often the property of individuals — Ac 27:11.","refs":[["Acts",27,11,27,11]]},{"text":"Commanded by a master — Jon 1:6; Ac 27:11.","refs":[["Jonah",1,6,1,6],["Acts",27,11,27,11]]},{"text":"Guided in their course by pilots — Eze 27:8,27-29.","refs":[["Ezek",27,8,27,8],["Ezek",27,27,27,29]]},{"text":"Governed and directed by the helm — Jas 3:4.","refs":[["Jas",3,4,3,4]]},{"text":"Course of frequently directed by the heavenly bodies — Ac 27:20.","refs":[["Acts",27,20,27,20]]},{"text":"Worked by mariners or sailors — Eze 27:9,27; Jon 1:5; Ac 27:30.","refs":[["Ezek",27,9,27,9],["Ezek",27,27,27,27],["Jonah",1,5,1,5],["Acts",27,30,27,30]]},{"text":"Generally impelled by sails — Ac 27:2-7.","refs":[["Acts",27,2,27,7]]},{"text":"Often impelled by oars — Jon 1:13; Joh 6:19.","refs":[["Jonah",1,13,1,13],["John",6,19,6,19]]},{"text":"Rivers. — Isa 33:21.","refs":[["Isa",33,21,33,21]]},{"text":"Lakes. — Lu 5:1,2.","refs":[["Luke",5,1,5,1],["Luke",5,2,5,2]]},{"text":"The ocean. — Ps 104:26; 107:23.","refs":[["Ps",104,26,104,26],["Ps",107,23,107,23]]},{"text":"Soundings usually taken for, in dangerous places — Ac 27:28.","refs":[["Acts",27,28,27,28]]},{"text":"Usually distinguished by signs or figure heads — Ac 28:11.","refs":[["Acts",28,11,28,11]]},{"text":"Course of, through the midst of the sea, wonderful — Pr 30:18,19.","refs":[["Prov",30,18,30,18],["Prov",30,19,30,19]]},{"text":"Trading. — 1Ki 22:48; 2Ch 8:18; 9:21.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,48,22,48],["2Chr",8,18,8,18],["2Chr",9,21,9,21]]},{"text":"Fishing. — Mt 4:21; Lu 5:4-9; Joh 21:3-8.","refs":[["Matt",4,21,4,21],["Luke",5,4,5,9],["John",21,3,21,8]]},{"text":"War. — Nu 24:24; Da 11:30,40.","refs":[["Num",24,24,24,24],["